      OAI.EditApproximation.BinaryFraction.querySharedCellInputsWithWork M F Q eM eb eF hM hF parent exponent cell (draw (2 ^ eb) cell)) cells.1
    (states.1, side.2 + cells.2 + states.2 + eb + exponent + 4)) scales.1
